This dispositively proves that with the documented dual-ref push,
stranger clones get the bootstrap-required ref and `loam init <ws>`
will succeed instead of failing with `fatal: 'origin/framework-only'
is not a commit`. (Smoke tmp dirs cleaned post-verification.)

